
### 1. Create
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/profiles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Eshamat",
  "surname": "Eshamtev",
  "email": "eshamat@example.com",
  "phone": "+998943219191",
  "password": "21212121345"
}

### 2. Get all
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/profiles

### 3. Get by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/profiles/1

### 4. Update
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/profiles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tanka",
  "surname": "Tankayev",
  "email": "tanka@example.com",
  "phone": "+998942324567",
  "password":"145"
}

### 5. Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/v1/profiles/1
